{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NkBNywfTjv824e28bJUis8","type":"tool_result","content":"The page doesn't fully answer this.\n\n**HR in workout text:** Heart rate targets use \"60% HR (of max heart rate)\" or \"100% LTHR (of threshold HR)\". Ranges use the same syntax as power, such as \"80-90%\". Zones work too: \"60m Z2 HR\" targets heart rate zone 2. Power and HR steps can be mixed in one workout, and HR-based load is calculated using HRSS.\n\n**workout_doc JSON:** The page doesn't describe this format, so I can't confirm the start/end/value/units fields.\n\n**Garmin export:** The page says workouts pushed through the Garmin Connect integration support the \"Press lap\" option. It doesn't say whether a % LTHR range is exported as a custom bpm range or as zones. You'd need to check the Garmin export output directly or ask on the forum."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aead6fde-9dd9-41be-99d0-f30d0696517c","uuid":"6b77a65d-e640-4b19-8217-66f8f9ebf319","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:03:03.884Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":62068,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"The page doesn't fully answer this.\n\n**HR in workout text:** Heart rate targets use \"60% HR (of max heart rate)\" or \"100% LTHR (of threshold HR)\". Ranges use the same syntax as power, such as \"80-90%\". Zones work too: \"60m Z2 HR\" targets heart rate zone 2. Power and HR steps can be mixed in one workout, and HR-based load is calculated using HRSS.\n\n**workout_doc JSON:** The page doesn't describe this format, so I can't confirm the start/end/value/units fields.\n\n**Garmin export:** The page says workouts pushed through the Garmin Connect integration support the \"Press lap\" option. It doesn't say whether a % LTHR range is exported as a custom bpm range or as zones. You'd need to check the Garmin export output directly or ask on the forum.","durationMs":6769,"url":"https://forum.intervals.icu/t/workout-builder-syntax/1163"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NkBNywfTjv824e28bJUis8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
